<mxCell id="n11" value="The API reads the breaker record in the Breaker table before it grants the lease" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="175" y="500.5" width="250" height="37" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n23" value="Retryable outcome: no delete. The message visibility is set to the backoff and SQS redelivers it; after max receives it moves to the DLQ (PARKED, alert). A lost message is re-dispatched by the Sweeper Lambda." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="915" y="954.5" width="430" height="49.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
